\nTheil index of dispersion: {theil_index}\")\nprint(f\"Rounded to 3 decimal places: {round(theil_index, 3)}\")\nEOF"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
